[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.999
As you see from this very real
photo of Trump arriving

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.300
at the White House on Friday

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.201
with the wind exposing
his hairline.

00:02:49.201 --> 00:02:52.672
He looks just like he went to
the beach wearing a dog cone.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.240
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.209
Trump only cares about the top
1%, even when he's applying

00:02:57.209 --> 00:03:00.213
