[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.485
"Ready for takeoff."

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:07.853
[ Laughter ]
[ Applause ]

00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:11.023
Anyway, the point is, Trump's
Republican coconspirators

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:12.625
